  "claim_register": [
    {
      "claim_id": "WF-EV-058: C&A PV review",
      "claim": "WF-EV-058: C&A PV review\n\nThe design compares the latest trade version with its prior version using T-1 EOD market data.\nMiddle Office reviews the resulting PV difference for in-scope cancellations and amendments.\nThe linked Middle Office policy was not inspected; the June 2026 remediation target is not delivery evidence.\n[Selected source, original lines 9\u201311](../../../../knowledge/evidence/sources/sha256/c1d5374d6d690b605cfa0962e33d6ed19c06e80903fe859e9630791cf22de4b9.md#L9-L11)\n",
      "support": [
        {
          "sha256": "c1d5374d6d690b605cfa0962e33d6ed19c06e80903fe859e9630791cf22de4b9",
          "range": [
            9,
            11
          ]
        }
      ],
      "confidence": "high for scoped source meaning; current applicability unknown"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WF-EV-059: C&A phases",
      "claim": "WF-EV-059: C&A phases\n\nMVP1 limits the proposal to SABRE FMRP Blade trades on the China Linear Rates desk.\nMVP2 proposes broader FMRP booking-entity coverage and nine additional non-PV C&A checks.\nAdoption and effective scope remain unverified.\n[Selected source, original lines 13\u201316](../../../../knowledge/evidence/sources/sha256/c1d5374d6d690b605cfa0962e33d6ed19c06e80903fe859e9630791cf22de4b9.md#L13-L16)\n",
