          ]
        }
      ],
      "confidence": "high for scoped source meaning; current applicability unknown"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WF-EV-060: C&A dependencies and schedule",
      "claim": "WF-EV-060: C&A dependencies and schedule\n\nThe design sends three daily PV batches for OVV and a separate EOD feed for previous-version trade PV.\nThe detailed batch table lists SGT, UKT, and UST windows; EOD uses UTC.\nA separate MRB description names SGT, GMT, and UST, so the second-batch label conflicts within this page.\nRATAN EOD supplies PV through OVV; RATAN ONE joins TDS3 trades and applies seven Middle Office rules.\nThe page leaves the user interface or report and user actions undecided.\nThe nine proposed non-PV checks and seven Middle Office rules describe different scopes; do not equate them.\n[Selected source, original lines 26\u201341](../../../../knowledge/evidence/sources/sha256/c1d5374d6d690b605cfa0962e33d6ed19c06e80903fe859e9630791cf22de4b9.md#L26-L41)\n",
      "support": [
        {
          "sha256": "c1d5374d6d690b605cfa0962e33d6ed19c06e80903fe859e9630791cf22de4b9",
          "range": [
            26,
            41
          ]
        }
      ],
      "confidence": "high for scoped source meaning; current applicability unknown"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "WF-EV-061: FX replication",
      "claim": "WF-EV-061: FX replication\n\nThe proposal filters Rates-desk Murex FX cash trades in real time before sending eligible trades to Razor for settlement.\nIt says users can inspect and modify rules in the MO Rules blotter.\nThe selected view does not include the rule predicates or a complete eligibility table.\n[Selected source, original lines 9\u201311](../../../../knowledge/evidence/sources/sha256/2780da890b2c1794723fddb105599400435ee131c917cff877687cb6ee03fc8f.md#L9-L11), [selected line 15](../../../../knowledge/evidence/sources/sha256/2780da890b2c1794723fddb105599400435ee131c917cff877687cb6ee03fc8f.md#L15), [selected line 55](../../../../knowledge/evidence/sources/sha256/2780da890b2c1794723fddb105599400435ee131c917cff877687cb6ee03fc8f.md#L55)\n",
